		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Ochre-skinned, tapir-nosed, nigh-immortal humanoid.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 10, <strong>HP</strong> 19, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 dagger +0 (1d4) or 1 spell +5, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Baffle (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 13. Focus. One target in near of LV 4 or less is dazed for the duration.</p><p></p><p><strong>Detect Magic (INT Spell)</strong>. Self. DC 11. Detect magic within near.</p><p></p><p><strong>Flame Bolt (CHA Spell)</strong>. DC 12. One target in far takes 2d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Long-Lived</strong>. No benefit or penalty from aging, immune to magical aging effects.</p><p></p><p><strong>Portal (INT Spell)</strong>. Self. DC 15. Open portal for 1 round, leads to location in same plane.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
